# The intimate steps of the romance page, moved word for word out of RomanceLines.cs and the
# spicy answers of Conversation.Unified.cs (criterion F7 of koikatsu-decisao-criterios-falas-fixas). Same situations as
# romance.dlg (on romance, on me.romance) and the same weights (@weights romance); Conversation.Romance.cs fills the keys.
# {act} feelings | tease | whisper | memories | private | sneak | bold | heldback | wary (what you did),
# {q} how she took it: yes | no, wary for a wary yes to sneaking off, maybe for a bold line she neither took nor refused,
# lead for the flustered beat before a wary yes, no_spicy for a wary no to a spicy line, and for heldback what held her
# back (Consent.HeldBack: personality | mood | guilt | girlfriend | soon | asked | grudge | neglected | name | other),
# {close} Lines.Closeness (2 = together), {lvl} intimate (feelings: your girlfriend, lewdness 70+), gf | notgf (whisper,
# bold), first | again (memories: her H count), moment (private: a real moment, not the H).

# ================= how she feels about you, intimate =================
@rule romance.feelings.intimate.gentle
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=intimate tone=gentle
feel shy
- You're my boyfriend... and the only one who gets to see me like... that. Don't make me say more!
- You're my boyfriend... and only you see me like... that. Don't make me say more!
- You're the only one I'd ever... um... you know.
- You're mine, and I'm yours... in every way. Ah, embarrassing!

@rule romance.feelings.intimate.energetic
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=intimate tone=energetic
feel shy
- You're my favorite person! And, um... I kinda can't stop thinking about you. In every way. Ehehe...
- You're my favorite! And I think about you ALL the ways! Ehehe!
- You're mine! Heart, body, everything! Too much?
- I can't stop thinking about you! Like, at all! In every way!

@rule romance.feelings.intimate.cool
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=intimate tone=cool
feel shy
- You're mine. All of you. That's what I think.
- You're mine. Entirely.
- All of you belongs to me.
- You're mine. Body included.

@rule romance.feelings.intimate.teasing
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=intimate tone=teasing
feel shy
- You're my boyfriend and my favorite toy. Is that honest enough for you?
- My boyfriend and my favorite plaything. Honest enough?
- Mine to love and mine to tease.
- You're my boyfriend. And my toy. Both.

# ================= teasing =================
@rule me.romance.tease.close
on me.romance
when act=tease close>=2
- You know what you look like right now? Very kissable.
- That skirt's a little short today. Not that I'm complaining.
- Is it hot in here, or is it just you?

@rule me.romance.tease.far
on me.romance
when act=tease close<=1
- You've been staring at me, haven't you?
- Careful, if you keep smiling like that I'll get ideas.
- You look really good today. Like, distractingly good.

@rule romance.tease.yes.close.gentle
on romance
when act=tease q=yes close>=2 tone=gentle
feel shy
- Y-you can't just say things like that on campus...! ...Say it again later.
- N-not on campus...! ...Say it again later.
- Y-you can't say that here...! Later, okay?
- Ah...! Not here... but later...
- I wore it for you... is that embarrassing?
- I wore it for you... is that weird?
- I chose this for you... um... do you like it?
- I hoped you'd notice...
- It's you... you make me feel hot all over...
- It's you... you make me feel so warm...
- You're why I'm so warm...
- Because of you... I'm burning up...

@rule romance.tease.yes.close.energetic
on romance
when act=tease q=yes close>=2 tone=energetic
feel shy
- Ehehe, you dummy! ...Okay, maybe a little kiss. Later!
- You dummy! ...Maybe a kiss later! Hehe!
- Hehe, later! A little one!
- Not now! Later, though!
- Hey! Eyes up here! ...Or not. I'm not your boss. Hehe.
- Eyes up here! ...Or not. Hehe!
- Hey! Looking?! ...It's okay!
- Caught you looking! Hehe!
- Hot?! Wh- you're the one making it hot! Jerk! ...Hehe.
- YOU'RE making it hot! Jerk! Hehe!
- Hot?! Your fault!
- It's you, dummy! Hehe!

@rule romance.tease.yes.close.cool
on romance
when act=tease q=yes close>=2 tone=cool
feel shy
- ...Keep that energy for when we're alone.
- ...Save that for privacy.
- ...When we're alone.
- ...Later. Remember it.
- Noticed, did you. Good.
- You noticed. Good.
- Hm. Observant.
- ...You looked. Good.
- It's me. Obviously.
- Me. Obviously.
- It's me.
- Both of us. Mostly me.

@rule romance.tease.yes.close.teasing
on romance
when act=tease q=yes close>=2 tone=teasing
feel shy
- Kissable? Then why are you still talking?
- Kissable? Then stop talking.
- Then come here.
- Words, words. Prove it.
- Short? Oh, you mean this? *She tugs the hem up a little, then lets it fall.* Oops.
- Short? This? Oops~
- Like it? I chose it to tease you.
- Noticed? That was the point.
- Both. Want to find out which is hotter?
- Both. Shall we compare?
- Find out which. Up close.
- Want to test which is hotter?

@rule romance.tease.yes.far.gentle
on romance
when act=tease q=yes close<=1 tone=gentle
feel shy
- I-I wasn't staring! ...Maybe a little.
- I wasn't staring...! Maybe a little...
- I-I wasn't looking...! Okay, a bit...
- Ah... you noticed...
- Ideas...? W-what kind of ideas...?
- Ideas...? What kind...?
- W-what ideas...?
- Um... ideas...?
- Th-thank you... I tried a little harder today...
- Thank you... I tried harder today...
- Ah... thank you... I put effort in...
- Thank you... I hoped you'd like it.

@rule romance.tease.yes.far.energetic
on romance
when act=tease q=yes close<=1 tone=energetic
feel shy
- Me?! Staring?! Pfft, no way! ...Okay, a tiny bit.
- Staring?! Me?! ...Okay, a little!
- Pfft! No! ...Yeah, a bit!
- Not staring! ...Okay, yes!
- Ideas, huh? Hehe, you're kinda bold! I like it!
- Bold! I like it!
- Ideas, huh?! Hehe!
- Ooh! What ideas?!
- Distractingly?! Ahaha, I'll take it!
- Distracting?! I'll take it!
- Hehe! Mission accomplished!
- Yes! Distraction successful!

@rule romance.tease.yes.far.cool
on romance
when act=tease q=yes close<=1 tone=cool
feel shy
- ...You noticed. Annoying.
- ...You caught it.
- ...Annoying that you noticed.
- ...Observant.
- Ideas. Hm. Keep them to yourself for now.
- Keep them to yourself. For now.
- Ideas. Hold them.
- Hm. Later.
- ...I'll accept the compliment.
- ...Compliment accepted.
- ...Thanks.
- ...Noted.

@rule romance.tease.yes.far.teasing
on romance
when act=tease q=yes close<=1 tone=teasing
feel shy
- And if I was? What would you do about it?
- And if I was?
- What if I was? Then what?
- I was. Problem?
- Get them, then. I want to see what you come up with.
- Show me your ideas.
- Go on. Surprise me.
- Let's see what you've got.
- Distracting you was the plan. Glad it's working.
- Distraction was the plan.
- Working, then. Good.
- I meant to distract you.

@rule romance.tease.no.gentle
on romance
when act=tease q=no tone=gentle
feel pout
- Th-that's embarrassing... please don't say that...
- P-please don't say that...
- That's so embarrassing...
- D-don't...

@rule romance.tease.no.energetic
on romance
when act=tease q=no tone=energetic
feel pout
- Ew, gross! ...Kidding. But no.
- Ew! ...Kidding. Still no.
- Gross! ...Nah. No.
- Yikes! Nope!

@rule romance.tease.no.cool
on romance
when act=tease q=no tone=cool
feel pout
- That was unnecessary.
- Unnecessary.
- Inappropriate.
- Don't.

@rule romance.tease.no.teasing
on romance
when act=tease q=no tone=teasing
feel pout
- Is that the best you've got? Pathetic. Try again someday.
- That's your best? Sad.
- Pathetic. Try again later.
- Weak. Very weak.

# ================= whispering =================
@rule me.romance.whisper.gf
on me.romance
when act=whisper lvl=gf
- *You lean in.* I can't stop thinking about last time. About your skin.
- *Quietly.* I want you. Right now. Here.
- *In her ear.* You smell amazing. I want to taste you.

@rule me.romance.whisper.notgf
on me.romance
when act=whisper lvl=notgf
- *You lean in.* You have no idea what I'm thinking about right now.
- *Quietly.* I keep imagining what you look like without the uniform.
- *In her ear.* If we were alone right now...

@rule romance.whisper.yes.gf.gentle
on romance
when act=whisper q=yes lvl=gf tone=gentle
feel love
- Hah... d-don't breathe on my ear like that... my legs are going weak...
- Hah... your breath... my knees are shaking...
- D-don't whisper there... I'm melting...
- Ah... my ear... I can't stand up...
- Me too... I keep remembering your hands on me...
- Me too... I remember your hands...
- I keep thinking about your touch...
- I still feel your hands on me...
- I-I'm all yours... just not in front of everyone...
- I'm yours... just not in public...
- All yours... somewhere private...
- I belong to you... later, okay?

@rule romance.whisper.yes.gf.energetic
on romance
when act=whisper q=yes lvl=gf tone=energetic
feel love
- Ahh, stop it! I'm getting all tingly! ...Don't stop.
- Stop! Tingly! ...Don't stop!
- Ahh! Shivers! ...More!
- Eek! Ticklish! ...Keep going!
- Ehehe, same! I even dreamt about it! ...Was that too honest?
- Same! I dreamt about it! Too honest?
- Me too! Every night! Oops!
- Hehe, I replay it constantly!
- Ahh, my face is on fire! You're the worst! ...I love it.
- My face is on fire! I love it!
- You're terrible! Do it again!
- Ahh! So red! More!

@rule romance.whisper.yes.gf.cool
on romance
when act=whisper q=yes lvl=gf tone=cool
feel love
