- ...Careful. I might take you somewhere private.
- ...Keep that up and we're leaving.
- ...Dangerous. Somewhere private, now.
- Then don't make me wait.
- Then don't keep me waiting.
- Then act.
- Don't make me wait.
- ...You'll pay for saying that in a hallway. Later.
- ...You'll pay for that later.
