- Here? You're reckless. I like that.
- Now? Bold. Good.
- Right here? Naughty boy.
- Mm, keep whispering. I want to see how red you can make me.
- Keep whispering. Make me redder.
- More. Make me blush.
- Go on. I want to burn.

