# ================= the last time =================
@rule me.romance.memories.first
on me.romance
when act=memories lvl=first
- I keep thinking about our first time.
- Do you ever think about... that day?
- That day... I haven't forgotten a single thing.

@rule me.romance.memories.again
on me.romance
when act=memories lvl=again
- I keep replaying last time in my head.
- You were incredible the other day.
- When can we do that again?

@rule romance.memories.yes.first.gentle
on romance
when act=memories q=yes lvl=first tone=gentle
feel love
- Our first time... I was so nervous, but you were gentle. I'll treasure it forever.
- Our first time... I'll treasure it forever.
- I was so scared, but you were gentle... thank you.
- I'll never forget it... our first time.

