# ================= sneaking off =================
@rule me.romance.sneak
on me.romance
when act=sneak
- Hey... want to sneak off somewhere quiet? Just the two of us.
- I know a spot where nobody goes. Come with me?
- Let's skip the next bit and find somewhere private.

@rule romance.sneak.yes.gentle
on romance
when act=sneak q=yes tone=gentle
feel love
- ...Okay. Lead the way. Just... be gentle, okay?
- Okay... lead me. Gently, please.
- Alright... I'll follow you. Be gentle.
- Mm... take me there. Softly.
- M-my heart won't calm down... let's go before I lose my nerve...
- My heart's racing... let's go before I chicken out...
- Quick... before I lose my courage...
- Let's go... my heart's pounding...

@rule romance.sneak.yes.energetic
